<div class="wdqs">
  <header class="intro">
    <div>
      <h1>Wikidata query rewriter</h1>
      <p>Convert a classic Wikidata SPARQL query in your browser, then explore the results.</p>
    </div>
    <button id="example" type="button">Load graph example</button>
  </header>

  <section class="workspace" aria-label="SPARQL editor">
    <div>
      <label for="original">Classic query</label>
      <textarea id="original" rows="11" spellcheck="false" autocapitalize="off" autocomplete="off"></textarea>
    </div>
    <div>
      <label for="rewritten">QLever rewrite</label>
      <textarea id="rewritten" rows="11" spellcheck="false" autocapitalize="off" autocomplete="off" placeholder="The rewritten SPARQL appears here."></textarea>
    </div>
    <div class="actions">
      <button id="rewrite" class="primary" type="button">Rewrite in browser</button>
      <label for="language">Label language <input id="language" value="en" maxlength="48" size="7"></label>
      <span id="rewrite-state" role="status"></span>
    </div>
    <ul id="diagnostics" class="diagnostics" hidden></ul>
  </section>

  <section class="results" aria-labelledby="results-title">
    <div class="result-header">
      <h2 id="results-title">Results</h2>
      <div class="actions">
        <label for="endpoint">Endpoint
          <select id="endpoint">
            <option value="classic">Blazegraph · classic query</option>
            <option value="qlever">QLever · rewrite</option>
          </select>
        </label>
        <button id="run" type="button" class="primary">Run query</button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p id="result-state" role="status"></p>
    <div id="result-controls">
      <div class="result-toolbar">
        <div role="tablist" aria-label="Result format">
          <button type="button" id="visual-tab" role="tab" aria-controls="visual-panel" aria-selected="true">Visualisation</button>
          <button type="button" id="raw-tab" role="tab" aria-controls="raw-panel" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1">Raw results</button>
        </div>
        <label id="view-choice" for="view">View <select id="view"></select></label>
      </div>
      <div id="visual-panel" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="visual-tab" tabindex="0"></div>
      <div id="raw-panel" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="raw-tab" tabindex="0" hidden></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="coverage" id="coverage">
    <h2>Rewrite coverage</h2>
    <p>The pinned Wikimedia tool rewrote 434 of Martin Poulter’s 580 queries. Factoidal produced the same text for all 434. Both tools left 106 queries unchanged. Factoidal rewrote 19 that Wikimedia rejected, and neither returned query text for 21.</p>
    <p>Wikimedia’s own 213-fixture suite covers more migration rules and their error cases. The audit matched the outcome on 91 inputs, and matched the full output on 46 of Wikimedia’s 134 successful rewrites.</p>
    <p><a href="https://github.com/danbri/factoidal-core/blob/f993737f9d76dd8f0525472a1b531eb1446ee79a/docs/20261124-mlp-wikidata-catalogue.md#exact-output-and-jsonl-compatibility">Pinned oracle and audit</a> · <a href="https://mlp-wikidata-workbench.danbri.chatgpt.site/">Browse the full Poulter corpus</a> · <a href="https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Wikidata:SPARQL_query_service/Wikidata_Query_Help/Result_Views">WDQS result views</a></p>
  </section>
</div>
